   "limits": "Classification plots were placed in stands chosen as typical of a vegetation type, not at random, and a 10 km tile holds few of them (rare types such as river banks are over-counted). The reference is percent cover; the drawn shares are counts of plants. The pipeline moves dwarf shrubs to its ground layer; the plots record them as short shrubs. Read the scores as a ranking of what is most wrong."
